nt","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2107.03374","title":"Scott Gray, and 39 others. 2021a. Evaluating large language models trained on code"},{"raw_text":"Universal self-consistency for large language models\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXinyunChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRenatAksitov\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tUriAlon\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJieRen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKefanXiao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPengchengYin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSushantPrakash\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tCharlesSutton\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXuezhiWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDennyZhou\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tICML 2024 Workshop on In-Context Learning\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Universal self-consistency for large language models"},{"raw_text":"Teaching large language models to self-debug\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXinyunChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMaxwellLin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNathanaelSchärli\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDennyZhou\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe Twelfth International Conference on Learning Representations\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Teaching large language models to self-debug"},{"raw_text":"2024c. Chatunitest: A framework for llm-based test generation\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYinghaoChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZehaoHu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChenZhi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJunxiaoHan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShuiguangDeng\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJianweiYin\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCompanion Proceedings of the 32nd ACM International Conference on the Foundations of Software Engineering","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"2024c. Chatunitest: A framework for llm-based test generation"},{"raw_text":"Discriminative reranking for natural language parsing\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMichaelCollins\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTerryKoo\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tComputational Linguistics\n\t\t\n\t\t\t31\n\t\t\t1\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2005","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Discriminative reranking for natural language parsing"},{"raw_text":"FriedDaniel\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAghajanyanArmen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLinJessy\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWangSida\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWallaceEric\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFredaShi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t